    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/ae71d92cfbddc5720416573b282330b8.poster.avif?t=1743889399\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/ae71d92cfbddc5720416573b282330b8.webm?t=1743889399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/ae71d92cfbddc5720416573b282330b8.mp4?t=1743889399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Jelly Farm, where farm fun gets a sweet twist! Embark on a colorful and addictive adventure as you run a unique farm where everything is made of food. Plant vibrant crops and harvest resources to create unique treats that will make your farm shine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/25ee59e1ab70c61427857e38146aa4d4.webp?t=1743889399\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/9653070885ac54b3ef2ca9e621cd87fb.poster.avif?t=1743889399\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/9653070885ac54b3ef2ca9e621cd87fb.webm?t=1743889399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/9653070885ac54b3ef2ca9e621cd87fb.mp4?t=1743889399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(explore and cultivate)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jelly Farm is the perfect place to relax, have fun and discover your inner jelly farmer! Get ready to build your own dream farm and reap the rewards of a lifetime of fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/24d8d0921b49697cf4a75ba90c5628f0.webp?t=1743889399\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/ae71d92cfbddc5720416573b282330b8.poster.avif?t=1743889399\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/ae71d92cfbddc5720416573b282330b8.webm?t=1743889399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/ae71d92cfbddc5720416573b282330b8.mp4?t=1743889399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Jelly Farm, where farm fun gets a sweet twist! Embark on a colorful and addictive adventure as you run a unique farm where everything is made of food. Plant vibrant crops and harvest resources to create unique treats that will make your farm shine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/25ee59e1ab70c61427857e38146aa4d4.webp?t=1743889399\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/9653070885ac54b3ef2ca9e621cd87fb.poster.avif?t=1743889399\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/9653070885ac54b3ef2ca9e621cd87fb.webm?t=1743889399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/9653070885ac54b3ef2ca9e621cd87fb.mp4?t=1743889399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(explore and cultivate)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jelly Farm is the perfect place to relax, have fun and discover your inner jelly farmer! Get ready to build your own dream farm and reap the rewards of a lifetime of fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323860/extras/24d8d0921b49697cf4a75ba90c5628f0.webp?t=1743889399\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p>",
